  "limitations": [
    "P02 is not complete. No x86-64-v2/v3, Linux userspace, physical x86 reference, glibc/systemd, stress or release qualification is claimed.",
    "Optional XCTest boot fixture is absent in these unit gates; it is explicitly skipped. Required mode rejects absence.",
    "Alpine stock initramfs requires matching installation media and is not the bounded workload fixture. Its three probes failed their acceptance criteria.",
    "The two one-million-instruction snapshots match all serialized CPU state fields; RAM/device equality was not captured and run UUIDs differ. This is not complete machine parity.",
    "PAE/PSE/PGE remain unadvertised pending the controls/latched-PDPTE/reserved-bit gates in the paging audit.",
    "Custom profiles do not qualify XSAVE/AVX execution. ByteArray legacy convenience allocation may trap on host exhaustion; production PC RAM uses throwing mmap.",
    "P03 and P04 remain pending because the requested phase order is P02, then P03, then P04."
  ]
